  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "Ng\xF4 V\u0103n Ch\u1EA5n"
    Lines:
    - "(Th\u1EDF d\xE0i, gi\u1ECDng ch\xE2n th\xE0nh) V\xEC ch\xFAa c\xF4ng ta bi\u1EBFt:
      thay v\xEC ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t m\u1ED9t anh h\xF9ng, kh\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng thu ph\u1EE5c
      m\u1ED9t anh h\xF9ng."
    - "C\xF4ng t\u1EED c\u1EA7n g\xEC? Qu\xE2n l\xEDnh, l\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EA3o,
      v\u0169 kh\xED, \u0111\u1EA5t \u0111ai. Ch\xFAa c\xF4ng ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 cho.
      C\xF2n ch\xFAa c\xF4ng ta c\u1EA7n g\xEC? Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\xE0i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      c\xF3 kh\xED ph\xE1ch, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE1m x\xF4ng pha tr\u1EADn m\u1EA1c.
      C\xF4ng t\u1EED ch\xEDnh l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF3."
    - "M\u1ED9t b\xEAn c\u1EA7n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\xE0i. M\u1ED9t b\xEAn c\u1EA7n
      t\xE0i nguy\xEAn, ngu\u1ED3n l\u1EF1c, qu\xE2n l\u1EF1c. T\u1EA1i sao kh\xF4ng
      h\u1EE3p t\xE1c?"
